#	Origin: EmberBSD (Linux 6.18 i915 driver)
#
# DRAFT of the file list of the i915 driver of Linux 6.18 (dist618/drm/i915)
# for config(1): the 279 sources of the working set for Arrow Lake 8086:7d67 after
# the files that the chosen Kconfig options leave out are taken away (the
# block at the end says which and why).  Not included from sys/conf/files and not
# used by any module yet: the driver has no autoconfiguration glue and does not link.
#
# The first block compiles against the layer (clang -c, the flags of the
# drmkms618 module, the warning waivers of the virtiogpu618 module); the second
# is not yet there, the reason in the comment is the first compiler error.
# Counts are in drm618/README.
#
# Written from the measurement of the compile progress; regenerate it with the
# measurement script when the layer grows.

